1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,550
Every AI agent you've built…

2
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:03,750
has worked alone.

3
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:05,220
One task, at a time.

4
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:07,060
Until now.

5
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:11,750
OpenAI's Responses API now has Multi-agent.

6
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:12,800
Flip one flag…

7
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:17,220
and the model spawns its own team of subagents, under one root agent.

8
00:00:17,450 --> 00:00:18,940
They work in parallel.

9
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,940
Up to three at a time, by default.

10
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:23,550
The API runs the teamwork for you.

11
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:27,540
Spawn. Message. Follow up. Wait. Interrupt. List.

12
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:31,390
Every step is recorded in the response, so you see who did what.

13
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,480
Then the root agent merges it all into one answer.

14
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:36,910
Multi-agent.

15
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:37,920
Now in beta.

16
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,130
Check the docs for what's supported today.

17
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:43,470
Stop prompting an agent.

18
00:00:43,270 --> 00:00:44,930
Start directing a team.
